@* Cookie consent banner. Shown on first visit only. Strictly necessary cookies
   (sign-in, anti-forgery) continue either way. No optional providers are
   configured, so both choices keep the site fully functional. *@
<div id="cookie-banner" role="region" aria-label="Cookie consent" hidden>
    <div class="container py-3">
        <p class="mb-2"><strong>Cookies on AcxiomCRM.</strong> Necessary cookies keep sign-in and forms working. Optional cookies (analytics, media, ads) are currently none, and would need your prior consent. See the <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Legal" asp-action="Cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" id="cookie-accept" class="btn btn-primary">Accept optional cookies</button>
            <button type="button" id="cookie-reject" class="btn btn-secondary">Reject optional cookies</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
